    <briefdescription>
<para>Read-only visitor for ONNX proto objects. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Covers Nodes, Graphs, <ref refid="structONNX__LIGHT__NAMESPACE_1_1Attributes" kindref="compound">Attributes</ref>, and Functions. Each <computeroutput>VisitX</computeroutput> method calls the corresponding <computeroutput>ProcessX</computeroutput> virtual method; if <computeroutput>ProcessX</computeroutput> returns <computeroutput>true</computeroutput> the traversal continues into the children of the visited element.</para>
<para>Subclasses should override one or more <computeroutput>ProcessX</computeroutput> methods to observe elements during traversal, and may override <computeroutput>VisitX</computeroutput> methods to change how children are enumerated. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
